msgid "* Error alerts during installation generally do not prevent the program from working correctly."
msgstr "* Veateated installimise ajal ei takista tavaliselt programmi õigesti töötamast."
msgid "Read before proceeding with the installation:"
msgstr "Loe enne installimisega jätkamist:"
msgid ""
"Prefer native packages, built for BigLinux, Manjaro, Arch, or other Linux systems compatible with "
"the <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"Another option is to use programs made for any Linux system, usually in <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.run</span>, <span color='#CC2222'>.appimage</span>, or <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.flatpak</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"If the program is not available in the formats above, the <span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> file "
"can be converted to <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> and installed on this system. However, "
"the installation may not work correctly."
msgstr ""
"Eelista kohalikke pakette, mis on loodud BigLinuxi, Manjaro, Archi või teiste Linuxi süsteemide "
"jaoks, mis on ühilduvad <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> formaadiga.\n"
"\n"
"Teine võimalus on kasutada programme, mis on loodud mis tahes Linuxi süsteemi jaoks, tavaliselt "
"<span color='#CC2222'>.run</span>, <span color='#CC2222'>.appimage</span> või <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.flatpak</span> formaadis.\n"
"\n"
"Kui programmi ei ole ülaltoodud formaatides saadaval, saab <span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> faili "
"konverteerida <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> formaati ja installida sellele süsteemile. "
"Siiski ei pruugi installimine õigesti toimida."
msgid ""
"<big>This system uses the <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> package format, but the file is in "
"<span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"Do you wish to proceed with the installation?</big>\n"
msgstr ""
"<big>See süsteem kasutab <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> paketi formaati, kuid fail on <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> formaadis.\n"
"\n"
"Kas soovite jätkata installimist?</big>"
msgid "Install & Review Config Files"
msgstr "Installi ja ülevaata konfiguratsioonifailid"
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Installi"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Sulge"
msgid "Install .deb package"
msgstr "Installige .deb pakett"
msgid "Converting file, please wait. This may take a few minutes..."
msgstr "Faili konverteerimine, palun oota. See võib võtta paar minutit..."
